1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,611
Supabase serves the primary image.
R2 holds a copy with the same file key.

2
00:00:11,611 --> 00:00:24,823
The API returns a Supabase URL.
The browser loads the primary image.

3
00:00:24,823 --> 00:00:39,991
Supabase images are blocked in this browser.
The app automatically loads the R2 copy.

4
00:00:39,991 --> 00:01:00,194
This image request is held open.
After 10 seconds, the app switches to R2.

5
00:01:00,194 --> 00:01:13,726
Remove the browser block and reload.
The image loads from Supabase again.

6
00:01:13,726 --> 00:01:27,920
Only image requests were interrupted.
The database and API stayed online.
